  "name": "Alley Stan and Vic",
  "node": "asset_1792499942812_4atk6epou",
  "parameters": {
    "backgroundAssetId": "asset_1792499942812_4atk6epou",
    "dialogTree": {
      "characterRef": "char_1792094383279_wzb17mkkt",
      "choices": [
        {
          "dialogNode": {
            "characterRef": "char_1792094383279_wzb17mkkt",
            "choices": [
              {
                "dialogNode": {
                  "choices": [
                    {
                      "dialogNode": {
                        "choices": [
                          {
                            "dialogNode": {
                              "choices": [
                                {
                                  "dialogNode": {
                                    "choices": [
                                      {
                                        "dialogNode": {
                                          "choices": [
                                            {
                                              "dialogNode": {
                                                "choices": [
                                                  {
                                                    "dialogNode": {
                                                      "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                          "dialogNode": {
                                                            "choices": [
                                                              {
                                                                "id": "choice_1792580084595",
                                                                "target": "beat_y5p7zqk2",
                                                                "text": "\"Thank you!\"",
                                                                "visible": true
                                                              }
                                                            ],
                                                            "id": "node_1792580070871",
                                                            "speaker": "Stan",
                                                            "text": "\"I shouldn't have been looking the other way. But those excuses are just excuses. \nSo, I’m truly sorry, Vic\". "
                                                          },
                                                          "id": "choice_1792579693482",
                                                          "text": "....",
                                                          "visible": true
                                                        }
                                                      ],
                                                      "id": "node_1792579675707",
                                                      "speaker": "Stan",
                                                      "speakerState": "state_1792518103600",
                                                      "text": " \"I didn't notice she was hurting you, even though deep down I knew what she was doing\". "
                                                    },
                                                    "id": "choice_1792579627321",
                                                    "text": "...",
                                                    "visible": true
                                                  }
                                                ],
                                                "id": "node_1792535032102",
                                                "speaker": "Stan",
                                                "speakerState": "state_1792518103600",
                                                "text": "\"I thought it was just jokes and you were ok with it\"."
                                              },
                                              "id": "choice_1792535002616",
                                              "text": "\"You didn't know.\"",
                                              "visible": true
                                            }
                                          ],
                                          "id": "node_1792534854967",
                                          "speaker": "Stan",
                                          "speakerState": "state_1792518103600",
                                          "text": "\"But I do!\n Vic, I apologize. I should have stopped Billie when she was mocking Tim and I should have stopped her when she was harassing you.\""
                                        },
                                        "id": "choice_1792534819024",
                                        "text": "\"You really don't need to. It's ok.\"",
                                        "visible": true
                                      }
                                    ],
                                    "id": "node_1792534757207",
                                    "speaker": "Stan",
                                    "speakerState": "state_1792515162720",
                                    "text": "\"That's why I have to apologize. I'm not apologizing for her. She should do it herself.\""
                                  },
                                  "id": "choice_1792534707209",
                                  "text": "\"Maybe...\"",
                                  "visible": true
                                }
                              ],
                              "id": "node_1792501107179",
                              "speaker": "Stan",
                              "speakerState": "state_1792517853756",
                              "text": "\"It could be.  If I can't stop it, then I could at least try to reach someone who can.\""
                            },
                            "id": "choice_1792500973500",
                            "text": "\"Isn't that dangerous? Stopping crimes, I mean.\"\n",
                            "visible": true
                          }
                        ],
                        "id": "node_1792500953828",
                        "speaker": "Stan",
                        "speakerState": "state_1792517973629",
                        "text": "\"I don't know if I could stop it but I could at least try! \nMy parents taught me that if someone does not try to stop a crime that they see, they are guilty, too.\"\n"
                      },
                      "id": "choice_1792500895804",
                      "text": "\"To me? Why would you need that?\"\n",
                      "visible": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "id": "node_1792500871670",
                  "speaker": "Stan",
                  "speakerState": "state_1792517853756",
                  "text": "\"Me. I need to apologize to you...and to Tim.\"\n"
                },
                "id": "choice_1792500734863",
                "text": "\"What do you mean? Who needs to apologize?\"\n",
                "visible": true
              }
            ],
            "id": "node_1792500626545",
            "speaker": "Stan",
            "speakerState": "state_1792517853756",
            "text": "\"That's not true! Besides, I should've done that earlier. \nThen maybe Tim wouldn't have to change schools.\"\n\n\"Speaking of that... an apology is in order\".\n"
          },
          "id": "choice_1792500462812",
          "text": " \"I’m fine. \nWhy did you do that? I didn't think that you would care about me?\"\n You barely know me.",
          "visible": true
        }
      ],
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "id": "root",
      "speaker": "Stan",
      "speakerState": "state_1792487573790",
      "text": "\"How do you feel?\""
    },
